## Example 5 — Logical operators AND / OR
```bash
awk -F "|" '{if ($1==10 && $2 ~ /\.docx$/) print  $0}' report.txt
```
Both conditions must be true (`&&`).
**Output:**
```
010|Meeting_Minutes_Q3.docx|2026-09-02
```
